        "category": "plugin",
        "severity": "error",
        "description": "Read keyed sources from row or item atoms. A dependency on the collection couples each item projection to the list. Use a SourceAtom, ByKeyAtom, or IndexAtom for item reads. Keep route and list projections separate, with names that describe that role. This rule identifies collection reads by atom name. A new name for the collection leaves the item dependency intact.",
